MIM.reg("dx_sunflower",{"v":1,"seen":"A tall sunflower. A big round head at the top: a brown seed centre with dark seed dots, ringed by twelve long yellow-gold petals with dark outlines. A thin straight dark stem goes down from under the head to the bottom of the page, and one green oval leaf sticks out up and to the left from the stem near the bottom. No ground or pot is drawn.","kind":"grow","scene":"meadow","parts":[{"id":"flower","role":"hero","items":"rest"},{"id":"leaf","parent":"flower","items":["1.0","5.0"],"pivot":[49.2,83.9],"motion":[{"type":"sway","amp":9,"freq":0.9,"phase":0.3,"drive":"wind"}]},{"id":"head","parent":"flower","items":["1.1-5","2.*","3.*","4.*","6.*","7.*"],"pivot":[50,58.5],"motion":[{"type":"sway","amp":5,"freq":0.6,"drive":"wind"}]}],"silly":"The sunflower shoots up out of the grass with a boing, a big gust of wind blows it wildly back and forth with its head bobbing and its leaf flapping, then it does a huge sneeze and shoots its petals everywhere, and wobbles happily.","cool":"The sunflower grows smoothly up out of the meadow, its head gently swaying on top of its stem and its leaf waving in the breeze, while a little bee buzzes round it and sparkles float up."});
